The fixtures contain release configuration, tokenizer/processor metadata,
serialized BPE vocabulary, checkpoint index and a safetensors header only.
They do not contain trained neural-network weight payloads.

Model/config/vision/text/MoE/cache/generation/media processing are implemented
by the installed Transformers dependency, not copied checkpoint Python:
